{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"grp-pipeline","type":"group","x":-120,"y":-1000,"width":1680,"height":3180,"color":"1","label":"月結流程 Monthly Pipeline (2026-08) — ✅ 已完成 Completed"},
		{"id":"fe731727390318d7","x":1239,"y":-1170,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":""},
		{"id":"n-title","type":"text","text":"# Global Purchase Report RPA\n## Monthly PowerShell Pipeline — 2026-08 ✅ Completed 2026-09-23","x":-40,"y":-760,"width":500,"height":80},
		{"id":"n-step1","type":"text","text":"### 1. Build-GlobalPurchaseReport.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 合併7個實體資料＋更新匯率表，產出當月新報表\nMerges all 7 entities' data + updates the exchange rate block, produces this month's new Report file\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — 7個實體皆處理成功：MHK 794列、STC 1850列、MZQ 692/6199列、MIL 2518/17194列、RACO 395/3003列、TVS 23/3274列、MAZAL 26/967列\nAll 7 entities processed successfully with the row counts above\n⚠️ RACO 分頁名稱主控台顯示亂碼但屬正常 fallback（來源檔只有 Sheet1，已知並記錄於 SOP，不影響結果）；PEN 匯率照常留白 待步驟1.5視情況補上\nRACO sheet-name console mojibake is a known/documented fallback (source only has Sheet1) - harmless; PEN rate left blank as usual, pending step 1.5 if needed","x":-20,"y":-600,"width":850,"height":150},
		{"id":"n-step1-5","type":"text","text":"### 1.5 Get-PenExchangeRate.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 補 STANDARD EXCHANGE RATE.xls 缺少的 PEN 匯率（MAZ 用），寫入 Exchange Rate 分頁 M欄\nFills the PEN rate gap (needed for MAZ), writes it into the Exchange Rate tab column M\n**Status 狀態:** ❓ 本月未確認 Unconfirmed this month — 尚未確認 MAZ 8月資料是否真的有 PEN 交易，需先檢查再決定是否要執行\nNot yet confirmed whether MAZ's August data actually includes any PEN transactions - check before deciding whether this step is needed","x":-20,"y":-420,"width":850,"height":150},
		{"id":"n-step2","type":"text","text":"### 2. 手動填 AA2:AB2 並計算 Manual AA2:AB2 fill + calculate\n**Purpose 用途:** 為新增列補上 Max/Min PO Price 公式，是後續步驟能否正確執行的前提\nFills Max/Min PO Price formulas for new rows — a precondition for the next step\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done（推斷 inferred）— 未在本次對話中直接觀察執行過程，但下游 OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx / VBA練習檔已確認 AC:AJ 欄位皆正確填值，證實本步驟與步驟3皆已完成\nNot directly observed in this session, but OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx / the VBA practice file were later confirmed to already have AC:AJ correctly populated, confirming this step (and step 3) were completed","x":-20,"y":-240,"width":850,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-step3","type":"text","text":"### 3. Complete-FormulaColumns.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 依相依順序逐欄填入並凍結 AC~AI 公式，並產出「新供應商」複核表\nFills/freezes columns AC–AI in dependency order, builds the New Vendors review sheet\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done（推斷，見步驟2說明 inferred, see step 2）— AC:AJ 已於下游檔案確認填值 confirmed populated in downstream files","x":-20,"y":-70,"width":850,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-tvs","type":"text","text":"### Update-TVSTranslations.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 修正 TVS 翻譯欄與 Commodity Code\nFixes TVS's translation column and Commodity Code\n**本月狀態:** ✅ 已完成（推斷）Done (inferred) — TVS 8月原始檔已於 2026-09-17 收到（Downloads\\TVS.xlsx）；Build 腳本後續成功處理 TVS（23/3274列），代表已放入 TVS 資料夾並完成前置處理；本腳本實際執行過程未在本次對話中直接觀察到\nAugust's raw TVS.xlsx was received 2026-09-17; the Build script later processed TVS successfully (23/3274 rows), implying it was placed in the TVS folder and prepped — running this script itself wasn't directly observed in this session","x":880,"y":-240,"width":280,"height":480},
		{"id":"n-step10-prodfami","type":"text","text":"### 10. ProdFamiDesc/ProdFamiCode/ProdFamilyFittingsCode（產品家族）+ HTML 報表擴充\n**Purpose 用途:** 來源 Excel 已擴充到第39欄（37: ProdFamiDesc, 38: ProdFamiCode, 39: ProdFamilyFittingsCode）；HTML 報表含點擊篩選、欄寬拖曳調整、Product Family 篩選、SKU/Part 家族圓餅圖、拆分 KPI 卡片\nSource Excel has grown to 39 columns (37: ProdFamiDesc, 38: ProdFamiCode, 39: ProdFamilyFittingsCode); HTML report has click-to-drilldown, drag-to-resize columns, Product Family filters, SKU/Part family pie charts, split KPI cards\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 8月已確認 OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx 與 VBA練習檔皆已是 A1:AM50263（39欄）結構，Fittings樞紐分析表依賴全部39欄\nAugust confirmed both OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx and the VBA practice file are already A1:AM50263 (39 cols); the Fittings pivot depends on all 39\n⚠️ 新發現重要風險（見步驟5）：Publish-OutsideReport.ps1 寫死36欄(A:AJ)假設，對已擴充至39欄的檔案直接執行會把表格縮回36欄、弄壞 Fittings 樞紐分析表\nNewly found risk (see step 5): Publish-OutsideReport.ps1 hardcodes a 36-column (A:AJ) assumption — running it against a file already expanded to 39 columns would shrink Table1 back down and break the Fittings pivot\nProdFamiDesc 目前仍不含 TVS 與 MAZ 資料（來源自動化尚未涵蓋，已另行申請）\nStill excludes TVS and MAZ (source automation doesn't cover them yet, requested separately)","x":-20,"y":1800,"width":980,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-step9-slack","type":"text","text":"### 9. New-MonthlySlackPost.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 發到 Slack `global_purchase_report` 私人頻道，附加互動式HTML報表\nPosts to the Slack `global_purchase_report` private channel, with the interactive HTML report attached\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — 2026-09-23 真的發布到頻道（HTML附件 34.8MB，50,262列）\nActually posted live to the channel (HTML attached, 34.8MB, 50,262 rows)\n本月起關閉一次性網頁版介紹文案（-IncludeHtmlIntro:$false，7月已介紹過）\nDropped the one-time web-version intro copy this month (-IncludeHtmlIntro:$false — already introduced in July)\n⚠️ 沒有草稿機制，執行後立刻真實發布，所有頻道成員馬上看得到\nNo draft concept — posts live immediately, visible to all channel members right away","x":-20,"y":1420,"width":980,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-step8-gmail","type":"text","text":"### 8. New-MonthlyEmailDraft.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 建立 Gmail 草稿通知（比照舊RPA收件人清單與主旨/內文格式，現為3位To+12位Cc — WSCheung已於2026-09-02移除，已離職）\nCreates a Gmail draft notice (matches the old RPA's subject/body format, now 3 To + 12 Cc — WSCheung removed 2026-09-02, left the company)\n**Status 狀態:** ⏳ 草稿已建立 Draft created 2026-09-23（id: r-3616236099678842769），尚未寄出\nDraft created (id above) — not yet sent\n只建草稿，絕不自動寄出；報表檔過大無法自動附加，需使用者自行手動附加、確認內容後親自寄出；本月起關閉一次性網頁版介紹文案\nOnly ever creates a draft, never auto-sends; the report file is too large to auto-attach — user still needs to manually attach it, review, and send; dropped the one-time web-version intro copy this month","x":-20,"y":1040,"width":850,"height":200},
		{"id":"n-step-html","type":"text","text":"### （選用 VBA - Optional）Generate-PurchaseReportHtml.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 轉成單一自包含互動式 HTML（圖表、篩選、CSV 匯出），方便手機/平板瀏覽\nConverts the finalized report into a single self-contained interactive HTML for mobile/tablet viewing\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done 2026-09-23 — 已用 `-Publish` 產出 FIN_Global_Purchase -Report_html_202608.html（34.8MB，50,262列）\nDone 2026-09-23 — published FIN_Global_Purchase -Report_html_202608.html (34.8MB, 50,262 rows) via `-Publish`\n⚠️ 重要架構發現：本腳本是依「巢狀 REPORT 資料夾」(`Global Purchase Report RPA\\REPORT\\`) 內最新的日期版交付檔（依檔名期間排序）自動判斷來源，並非直接讀取主報表或VBA練習檔——本月一度卡在7月版，因為8月的日期版交付檔（見步驟5）當時還沒被產生\nImportant architecture finding: this script auto-detects its source from the newest dated-deliverable file (sorted by the reporting period in its filename) in the NESTED `Global Purchase Report RPA\\REPORT\\` folder — not the root master report or the VBA practice file directly. It got stuck showing July this month simply because the August dated deliverable (see step 5) hadn't been created yet","x":-20,"y":820,"width":850,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-step4","type":"text","text":"### 4. New-ReportAuditSummary.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 產出稽核摘要：報表最後列號、各實體當月列數、當月總列數\nProduces an audit summary: last row, each entity's row count, total rows this month\n**Status 狀態:** ❓ 未確認是否執行 Unconfirmed whether run this month — 唯讀不影響其他步驟 read-only, doesn't block anything else","x":-20,"y":100,"width":850,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-step5","type":"text","text":"### 5. Publish-OutsideReport.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 將定稿報表發布/對外輸出這個月的最終版本\nPublishes/outputs the finalized version of this month's report externally\n**Status 狀態:** ⚠️ 本月刻意跳過此腳本 Deliberately skipped this month — 發現此腳本寫死36欄(A:AJ)假設，對已擴充到39欄的 OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx / VBA練習檔執行會用 Table1.Resize() 把表格縮回36欄、弄壞依賴39欄的 Fittings 樞紐分析表\nDiscovered this script hardcodes a 36-column (A:AJ) assumption; running it against the now-39-column OUTSIDETEMP files would Table1.Resize() them back down to 36 cols and break the Fittings pivot\n改為手動流程 Used a manual process instead：使用者自行重新整理樞紐分析表並另存新檔，產出 FIN_MHK+STC+MZQ+MIL+RACO_PUR_REPORT-(1-8)2026_20260923_RV0.xlsx（Claude 原本的自動化嘗試被安全機制以「不可逆本機異動」擋下，改由使用者親自執行完成）\nUser manually refreshed the pivots and Save-As'd FIN_MHK+STC+MZQ+MIL+RACO_PUR_REPORT-(1-8)2026_20260923_RV0.xlsx (Claude's own automated attempt was blocked by the safety classifier as \"irreversible local destruction\", so the user completed it directly)\n🔧 待辦 TODO：下次執行前需先修正腳本的欄數假設（改成自動偵測實際欄數），或先手動確認欄數是否仍為36欄\nTODO before next run: fix the script's column-count assumption (auto-detect instead of hardcoding), or manually confirm the column count is still 36 first","x":-20,"y":270,"width":850,"height":220},
		{"id":"n-vba-practice-issue","type":"text","text":"### ✅ 已解決 Resolved: OUTSIDETEMP_VBA_PRACTICE.xlsm\n跟 OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx 同一種已損壞/缺失的 data 命名範圍問題（曾影響18個樞紐分析表）——2026-08-27 人工在名稱管理員新增（非編輯）工作表層級名稱 data，指向 =Table1[#All]。已用三種方式交叉驗證：25個樞紐分析表全部重新整理成功、COUNTA(data)回傳合理列數、欄位名稱正確無誤。\nSame broken/missing `data` named-range issue OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx had (used to affect 18 PivotTables) — fixed 2026-08-27 by manually creating (not editing) a workbook-scoped `data` name pointing at `=Table1[#All]`. Cross-verified three ways: all 25 PivotTables refresh successfully, COUNTA(data) returns a sensible row count, and field names are all correct.\n**2026-09-23 8月更新 August update:** 使用者手動貼入8月 Data + Exchange Rate 資料後，Claude 重新整理全部25個樞紐分析表並存檔成功，PT_Timeline 已確認顯示 2026-08（$18,691,668）；Dashboard KPI Total Purchase = $142,493,283.996（Jan–Aug）。附帶發現：「Unique Vendors」KPI 顯示 50,262（跟總列數相同），疑似公式在算列數而非不重複廠商數，尚未修正。\nAfter the user manually pasted August's Data + Exchange Rate values, Claude refreshed all 25 PivotTables and saved successfully — PT_Timeline confirmed showing 2026-08 ($18,691,668); Dashboard KPI Total Purchase = $142,493,283.996 (Jan–Aug). Side finding, not fixed: the \"Unique Vendors\" KPI shows 50,262 (same as total row count) — likely counting rows rather than distinct vendors.","x":-20,"y":510,"width":850,"height":250,"color":"4"}
	],
